{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>譚嘉儀（Kayee）於2011年參加《超級巨聲3》奪得季軍後入行，近年宣佈離巢TVB並轉型為獨立歌手。日前適逢38歲生日，譚嘉儀無預警下宣佈迎來人生重大喜訊，獲圈外男友求婚成功！她隨即拍片逐一向一班圈中好姊妹報喜，大曬手上的巨型鑽石訂婚戒指，場面洋溢歡欣笑聲。</p><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀趁着38歲生日宣布訂婚喜訊，獲圈外男友求婚成功。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164952619072884736780612.jpeg/ODsYPxUzo9DAAyQRfl6MuSPTWb-bV6H6S0tTvEtLU7w\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀趁着38歲生日宣布訂婚喜訊，獲圈外男友求婚成功。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"更大曬巨型鑽戒，幸福滿瀉！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164952825894014976386917.jpeg/qCjDbBnwgrrMUbxKeiTJLwEYBiJT-K3rRmTt40Zk7eM\"/><figcaption>更大曬巨型鑽戒，幸福滿瀉！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀（Kayee）在2011年參加《超級巨聲3》奪得季軍後入行。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220419/593076862599565312512704.jpeg/jfk05EZLvkT7QI4BGqqXffDdWyhbXCaFwThMw8E4TMM\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀（Kayee）在2011年參加《超級巨聲3》奪得季軍後入行。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開船P。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230901/774348509905686528264517.jpeg/3c6zyNgVdYaISZ0Jc9QDtaT83r7742jCy5IFk8uSBZM\"/><figcaption>開船P。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><p>梁敏巧肉緊錫手　林鈺洧呆滯勁搞笑</p><p>譚嘉儀逐個向好姊妹分享喜訊，包括李芷晴、何珮瑜、林穎彤、黃嘉雯、郭柏妍、陳懿德、陳丹儀、林鈺洧、王海榛（前名：王子涵）以及梁敏巧等。當譚嘉儀高舉戴有巨型鑽戒的手，並說：「「我訂咗婚」！眾人的反應可謂千奇百怪、笑料百出。</p><p>其中，身為「TVB東張女神」的梁敏巧興奮到捉實譚嘉儀的手又錫又摸，激動得直呼：「你終於嫁得出嘞！」而與譚嘉儀十足孖公仔的港姐冠軍林鈺洧，在見到巨型鑽戒的一刻竟然當場「呆咗」，瞪大雙眼完全不懂得反應，呆滯了兩秒才回過神來替好友高興，要求擁抱，畫面相當搞笑。</p><figure><img alt=\"郭柏妍個樣好驚喜！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537222413455360871465.png/TacVsirVfRFR6rzF61nXh_px1zdmAdwrGyom-BsqJvg\"/><figcaption>郭柏妍個樣好驚喜！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳懿德。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537224707870720074635.png/-k2tnNAjXAPAEynupTynd187TiCq4Mvrcb92lHG_dpQ\"/><figcaption>陳懿德。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"梁敏巧對住鑽戒心心眼。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537412465758208928564.png/xDYVpsA-u84cFRevXUQDD6k4umkkrkI-H8uL5R_Li-U\"/><figcaption>梁敏巧對住鑽戒心心眼。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537633165840384367214.png/4e3QRt43sBbbkJwx1MAxfmITu_159xPhjL4ocoy-KHI\"/><figcaption>捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537635506393088624538.png/GryRGs3nboUmfM4VHJ3q8jRJAeHiJ2P1bgvfDm4L3w4\"/><figcaption>捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537637716922368450629.png/zIbHtmH50hPP1cZYVBndY2LAMKpF_suMprKxOaaysTk\"/><figcaption>捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537639856148480538927.png/uRk82AjDYIHIWHPwHRLnxc5bVDSFiG6Sf6Uh9n-lIfY\"/><figcaption>捉住嘉儀隻手唔願放。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好戥對方開心。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537632972902400852316.png/9wVmhbx8jWUNvUEFcYTzYGznuyWhueXTOHtwmzh7cJs\"/><figcaption>好戥對方開心。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超興奮。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537642217672704128597.png/kH5d0FMGLtaYGHLoHjRhgHt2Wp02QcoqSrsJ40q7CeM\"/><figcaption>超興奮。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"超興奮。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537635653193728723681.png/gExno4GHaT8oMDpXtQjsrrRi0LdM3QFOf-MUw3_jFMM\"/><figcaption>超興奮。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林鈺洧呆咗。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537715600691200267945.png/3iZF8UOol2sJKy-4aMmoHVXFjfY00kIak87OJ5POzic\"/><figcaption>林鈺洧呆咗。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林鈺洧呆咗。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537833867612160508764.png/VdhvPnzT45IBZ3BsY1cw2Hhn3WGX6GEGfVUfVH1VH1Q\"/><figcaption>林鈺洧呆咗。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"隔兩秒先識俾反應。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537836073947136749561.png/jD5PuTsdzSm3czpHSQs-aTODaMU9S7GKqMImO6jCJjs\"/><figcaption>隔兩秒先識俾反應。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"隔兩秒先識俾反應。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537831665471488728465.png/rNH64qmTJbl_pQcegAjrD0aJ5JsD0w1D_xlqKP8Zaig\"/><figcaption>隔兩秒先識俾反應。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王海榛都好興奮，攬實準新娘。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167537880642359296674082.png/l0aFAaNsC8R0UNxJl-ly_Zx4DZRfofPyzR7EsM0exLA\"/><figcaption>王海榛都好興奮，攬實準新娘。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李芷晴。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538063090388992436928.png/_G3AhuMrImueIEBztAFwjOvciiAkwSAhnLEmt5yxJrc\"/><figcaption>李芷晴。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開心又驚喜。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538067725357056798362.png/ccWMJmgI8bFvph6KnVCu28OlT2PQi0bWs5f5ibOX-Yk\"/><figcaption>開心又驚喜。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"何珮瑜。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538065435136000014926.png/3yYw6AY_7UrtnGCKN-A2T3nBYxG2ckBoxD49i8Q-PYs\"/><figcaption>何珮瑜。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開心又驚喜。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538069768114176781329.png/dpats_pqo1a_R-hr4ifa4MySz_gx0Gg52hlBVNoZQVQ\"/><figcaption>開心又驚喜。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林穎彤。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538071894757376385241.png/pRqGY8Pum12UR1eAgxHT5EDHaR1BzLTMiXnGX4l5xl8\"/><figcaption>林穎彤。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃嘉雯。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538063090388992874926.png/Y1TiTDpVnpL1pLo0g3Oh5TxAvbBCQq2BY58yv2OfMr8\"/><figcaption>黃嘉雯。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"向友人逐一展示求婚巨鑽戒指。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538065376415744380961.png/LNqmPGfen9yhkZ19Z2TY-f_TGc9HDD3fhsgBG4bIARs\"/><figcaption>向友人逐一展示求婚巨鑽戒指。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王海榛勁開心！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538067431755776051824.png/5APDrMQfA1gu6ZIFZQ1ejyOvOD691fR-GU2jfxlNo38\"/><figcaption>王海榛勁開心！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王海榛勁開心！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538071815065600870526.png/IPYymumreYhpnUt2vKU8pbXCubmIY3kHcaIc3HGiHNw\"/><figcaption>王海榛勁開心！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王海榛勁開心！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167538069734559744781340.png/j4PaiVaJTGEvSCP-jf0FGFvgC213D4c2Legamy3oGps\"/><figcaption>王海榛勁開心！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><p>頻傳「忽然富貴」　澄清未婚夫只屬普通人</p><p>近年譚嘉儀頻頻被指「忽然富貴」，除了不時大曬勞力士名錶、Chanel及LV等名牌手袋外，又經常出海開船P兼周遊列國度假；她更由大埔村屋搬進烏溪沙值千萬的無敵海景豪宅，早前駕駛保時捷（Porsche）的近況曝光後，再度掀起網民熱議。面對外界盛傳未婚夫財力驚人，譚嘉儀就澄清對方只是一位「普通人」。雖然未婚夫樣貌未有全面公開，但從身形可見男方高大健碩，給予她十足的安全感。如今踏入38歲兼宣佈封盤，一眾好姊妹見證她收獲幸福，紛紛送上最真摯的祝福。</p><figure><img alt=\"不時出海。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240626/882601569483231232694038.jpeg/xMLCdVgrCOd0BGHctmNBehXtGXR7DPVwOH4gwzh-IMM\"/><figcaption>不時出海。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有料！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240626/882601574390829056813529.jpeg/UKwVTUFevtkIkbkGFmQfOCrOuirm9mLAaV6C22legts\"/><figcaption>有料！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西班牙旅行。（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164259520906661888536178.jpeg/WxY9KUuvPiBsRoenA78Mf-bZClbmIjsuxfGTW8Xxk1s\"/><figcaption>西班牙旅行。（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣Bikini！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164259193134256128910642.jpeg/b3x1AANwCXoYhC02CM6RXupvIgbdOHh1j_GuVY_xrlU\"/><figcaption>火辣Bikini！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火辣Bikini！（IG@kayeepo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207084580769792014367.jpeg/kYlpCCO3zrXoMAuvKPwK9EUrN3fWJG6yt5sPrbebD60\"/><figcaption>火辣Bikini！（IG@kayeepo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"譚嘉儀揸車。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164255712713773056436580.jpeg/jZ2uBGs30M4Ux0jjLYU6KJWsKKNoF7JKuGUeILhlHiA\"/><figcaption>譚嘉儀揸車。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意外曝光其保時捷（Porsche）座駕。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164255708343046144895147.jpeg/1iCB2T7WQOsx4_LEL-mhhkoO7p6LzxAURgaq1kYGqtY\"/><figcaption>意外曝光其保時捷（Porsche）座駕。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T02:19:38.260924+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1404,"images":36,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}